# mpd-defaults.env — the default value of every Moodle-specific setting.
#
# Read this file to answer "what happens if I set nothing?" for a Moodle
# project.
#
# Do not edit it. It ships with mpd and an update overwrites it. To change a
# value, override it in a project's own /srv/projects/<name>/mpd.env (a type
# default like these wins over an ambient value from your runtime.env). Full
# model: docs/architecture.md, section 8.


# Behat
#
# 1 sets Behat up for the project, 0 leaves it alone.
#
# Off by default, because turning it on downloads the selenium image,
# which is over 2 GB. Switch it on when you are about to write or run
# Behat tests, and leave it off otherwise.
MPD_MOODLE_BEHAT=0
